  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "square (of a number); squaring",
      "explanation": "A number multiplied by itself, or the act of multiplying it so. Also written {自乗|じじょう}."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "31500_nijou_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{三|さん}→三：00749_san⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{二乗|にじょう}⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{九|きゅう}→九：00728_kyuu⟧だ。",
      "english": "Three squared is nine.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31500_nijou_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦この→この：00962_kono⟧⟦{数|かず}→数：00204_kazu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{二乗|にじょう}し⟦なさい→なさい：09856_nasai⟧。",
      "english": "Square this number.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31500_nijou_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{円|えん}→円：00774_en⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{面積|めんせき}→面積：05330_menseki⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{半径|はんけい}→半径：04331_hankei⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{二乗|にじょう}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{円周率|えんしゅうりつ}→円周率：28786_enshuuritsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧かけて⟦{求|もと}める→求める：02316_motomeru⟧。",
      "english": "The area of a circle is found by multiplying the square of the radius by pi.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "⟦{二|に}→二：00736_ni⟧ (two) + {乗|じょう} (power). Higher powers follow the same pattern: {三乗|さんじょう} (cube), {十乗|じゅうじょう}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- X⟦の→の：09472_no⟧Y{乗|じょう}: X to the power of Y\n- {二乗|にじょう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to square\n- ⟦{平方根|へいほうこん}→平方根：25644_heihoukon⟧: square root\n\nUSAGE:\nIn area units ⟦{平方|へいほう}→平方：27997_heihou⟧ is used instead: ⟦{平方|へいほう}メートル→平方メートル：03148_heihoumeetoru⟧ (square meter).",
